Development Economics#,#Development Economics#,#HASS Concentration in Development Economics#,#Concentration in Development Economics

A concentration in Development Economics requires three subjects addressing world poverty and economic development. Not available to Economics (14-1) or Mathematical Economics (14-2) primary majors.

intro_econ, "Introductory Economics (required)" := 14.01/14.03

development_core, "Development Economics Core" := 14.73/14.74/14.75/14.76

total, "Total Requirements" := (intro_econ){>=1}, (development_core){>=2}
